 Sigbjørn Skjæret <sigbjorn.skjaeret@huggingface.co> 1787825718 +0200\ncommitter Sigbjørn Skjæret <sigbjorn.skjaeret@huggingface.co> 1787830163 +0200\n\nFACP (Fewer Acronym Classes Please)\n","verified_at":"2026-08-27T11:32:42Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commits/e5227ab28ee15350b7e0c96ba5ef98147111bd55","html_url":"https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commit/e5227ab28ee15350b7e0c96ba5ef98147111bd55","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commits/e5227ab28ee15350b7e0c96ba5ef98147111bd55/comments","author":{"login":"CISC","id":1629204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjkyMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1629204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC","html_url":"https://github.com/CISC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"CISC","id":1629204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjkyMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1629204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC","html_url":"https://github.com/CISC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CISC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"69a1269f705c8f92e3e7f4f6417c5235259c072a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commits/69a1269f705c8f92e3e7f4f6417c5235259c072a","html_url":"https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commit/69a1269f705c8f92e3e7f4f6417c5235259c072a"}]},{"sha":"ef6876693f058169161143dc8e301ac104b45373","node_id":"C_kwDOMU0YaNoAKGVmNjg3NjY5M2YwNTgxNjkxNjExNDNkYzhlMzAxYWMxMDRiNDUzNzM","commit":{"author":{"name":"danielhanchen","email":"danielhanchen@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-27T10:40:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"Daniel Han","email":"danielhanchen@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-27T11:46:51Z"},"message":"qwen4exp: bias the QSA selection per block, not per cell\n\nThe QSA bias is a graph input, so it is pinned on the host and uploaded every\ndecode, and at -c 32768 -np 4 its twelve copies were 768 of the 815 MiB of\nreserved host compute buffer.\n\nOnly one half of it needs a cell: whether the cell sits in the always-visible\ntail, and whether its block was pooled. Both are properties of the block. The\nother half - empty, other sequence, or in the future - is the plain visible/not\ntest the attention mask already carries over the same cells, so add that mask\ninstead of repeating it. The bias then holds one value per block.\n\nA block sits wholly inside or wholly outside the tail because the tail starts on\na block boundary, so one value per block is exact. Cells no block covers keep\ntheir -inf from the mask.\n\nThe mask is F16 and the bias F32, and a mixed ggml_add reinterprets the F16\nbuffer as float rather than converting it, so the cast is required.\n\nreserved host compute buffer at -c 32768 -np 4:\n  --kv-unified      814.86 -> 238.86 MiB, CUDA0 721.07 -> 421.07 MiB\n  --no-kv-unified   214.86 ->  70.86 MiB, CUDA0 317.07 -> 265.07 MiB\n\nSelection is unchanged: over 8192 tokens, four times the budget, every QSA\nlayer returns identical top-k indices and the logprobs are bitwise equal.\n\nTwo things a reviewer should know. A cell whose position divides past the last\nblock is guarded by an assert rather than handled, because no run reached it.\nAnd the mask's same-position M-RoPE rule cannot fire for text and was never\nexercised for images, so the 2D case is unverified.","tree":{"sha":"6220d4f1bae409a3a9673c8d038235611b90efbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/git/trees/6220d4f1bae409a3a9673c8d038235611b90efbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/git/commits/ef6876693f058169161143dc8e301ac104b45373","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commits/ef6876693f058169161143dc8e301ac104b45373","html_url":"https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commit/ef6876693f058169161143dc8e301ac104b45373","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commits/ef6876693f058169161143dc8e301ac104b45373/comments","author":{"login":"danielhanchen","id":23090290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDkwMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23090290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen","html_url":"https://github.com/danielhanchen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielhanchen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu